stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> STARTED: OrderCreated
    STARTED --> STOCK_RESERVING: envia ReserveStock

    STOCK_RESERVING --> PAYMENT_PROCESSING: StockReserved
    STOCK_RESERVING --> CANCELLING_ORDER: StockRejected (sem estoque)
    STOCK_RESERVING --> COMPENSATING: deadline_at vencido (N tentativas)

    PAYMENT_PROCESSING --> CONFIRMING_STOCK: PaymentApproved
    PAYMENT_PROCESSING --> COMPENSATING: PaymentRefused
    PAYMENT_PROCESSING --> PAYMENT_TIMEOUT: deadline_at vencido

    PAYMENT_TIMEOUT --> COMPENSATING: PaymentCancelled

    CONFIRMING_STOCK --> APPROVING_ORDER: StockConfirmed
    APPROVING_ORDER --> COMPLETED: OrderApproved

    COMPENSATING --> CANCELLING_ORDER: StockReleased
    CANCELLING_ORDER --> CANCELLED: OrderCancelled

    COMPENSATING --> COMPENSATION_FAILED: N tentativas esgotadas
    CANCELLING_ORDER --> COMPENSATION_FAILED: N tentativas esgotadas

    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    COMPENSATION_FAILED --> [*]: intervenção manual (via DLQ)
